    "preamble": "Chandrika Reddy vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 29 February, 2020 Author: J. Uma Devi Bench: J.Uma Devi The Hon'Ble Ms.JUSTICE J.Uma Devi Criminal Petition No.7708 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "This criminal petition is filed by the petitioner/ A-3, seeking to quash the proceedings in Crime No.414 of 2019 of Pedakakani Police Station, Guntur District, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 353, 272, 273, 420 r/w 34 I.P.C and Sections 57, 58, 59 and 62 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. The case on hand has also been filed questioning the proceedings in Crime No.414 of 2019 of Pedakakani Police Station, Guntur District, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 353, 272, 273, 420 r/w 34 I.P.C and Sections 57, 58, 59 and 62 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
